    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8832" root="حلج" body-key="H">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْلَجٌ</span></b>  The <i>thing on which is performed the
operation, upon cotton, signified by the verb</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">حَلَجَ</span>; (S, K;) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْلَجَةٌ</span></b> : (S, A, K:)
it is <i>of wood</i> or <i>of stone.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  See also
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْلَاجٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  Also (assumed tropical:)  The <i>axis</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مِحْوَر</span>) <i>of the sheave
of a pulley.</i> (K.)

